  data: {
    LLM: "Maintain the rhythm. If you lose the beat of the chant, you will be late to react when the match occurs. Focus on the dealer's hand movement.\n\nPeripheral Vision: Don't stare at the center. Watch the player whose turn it is next. If you see them flinching to slap, you should slap too.\n\nRhythmic Deception: Some high-level variants allow the current player to pause slightly or speed up their flip to bait opponents into a 'fake' slap (foul).",
    Player: "Maintain the rhythm. If you lose the beat of the chant, you will be late to react when the match occurs. Focus on the dealer's hand movement.\n\nPeripheral Vision: Don't stare at the center. Watch the player whose turn it is next. If you see them flinching to slap, you should slap too.\n\nRhythmic Deception: Some high-level variants allow the current player to pause slightly or speed up their flip to bait opponents into a 'fake' slap (foul).",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
